{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;There are rules to chestmaking. If you see a chest that doesn't follow the rules, it probably wants to eat you.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-Tony Kingsley, Master Sleuth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/2baa8a954629b237a93e4f751bc53fd8.avif?t=1771351669\" width=865 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mimic Sleuth is a mix of \u201cPapers, Please\u201d and \u201cThe Case of the Golden Idol\u201d set in a fantasy world where everything revolves around storing stuff in chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will venture into dungeons and learn what differentiates a real chest from a mimic. Then, armed with a rulebook filled to the brim with chest knowledge, you will amass more gold than you can count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/ea7a0ece1352f9554fe8f6a5a32796a8.poster.avif?t=1771351669\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/ea7a0ece1352f9554fe8f6a5a32796a8.webm?t=1771351669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/ea7a0ece1352f9554fe8f6a5a32796a8.mp4?t=1771351669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/bd695dabdb9f452761e931f4b373e5dc.avif?t=1771351669\" width=865 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you explore the dungeons, you will find all kinds of chests, all with unique quirks and rules. Once you figure them out, you can record these rules into your rulebook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/e06311c07a73ca2170cd4bc51ec565b6.poster.avif?t=1771351669\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/e06311c07a73ca2170cd4bc51ec565b6.webm?t=1771351669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/e06311c07a73ca2170cd4bc51ec565b6.mp4?t=1771351669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/cc6dc6bbd51e122e09d65016fece3f82.avif?t=1771351669\" width=865 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After a while you no longer depend on the rulebook and can start going with the flow, solving chest after chest without issue. After you master all the dungeons the game has to offer, you can test your skills with an endless mode and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/35a2e2a0b50f028affac6e82aeb13b80.poster.avif?t=1771351669\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/35a2e2a0b50f028affac6e82aeb13b80.webm?t=1771351669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848440?t=1771351669","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848440?t=1771351669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/44dffd9d6de69a4cfb3ce1d85a784167630f496b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771351669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/44dffd9d6de69a4cfb3ce1d85a784167630f496b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771351669","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4415300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;There are rules to chestmaking. If you see a chest that doesn't follow the rules, it probably wants to eat you.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-Tony Kingsley, Master Sleuth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/2baa8a954629b237a93e4f751bc53fd8.avif?t=1771351669\" width=865 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mimic Sleuth is a mix of \u201cPapers, Please\u201d and \u201cThe Case of the Golden Idol\u201d set in a fantasy world where everything revolves around storing stuff in chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will venture into dungeons and learn what differentiates a real chest from a mimic. Then, armed with a rulebook filled to the brim with chest knowledge, you will amass more gold than you can count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/ea7a0ece1352f9554fe8f6a5a32796a8.poster.avif?t=1771351669\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/ea7a0ece1352f9554fe8f6a5a32796a8.webm?t=1771351669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/ea7a0ece1352f9554fe8f6a5a32796a8.mp4?t=1771351669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/bd695dabdb9f452761e931f4b373e5dc.avif?t=1771351669\" width=865 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you explore the dungeons, you will find all kinds of chests, all with unique quirks and rules. Once you figure them out, you can record these rules into your rulebook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/e06311c07a73ca2170cd4bc51ec565b6.poster.avif?t=1771351669\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/e06311c07a73ca2170cd4bc51ec565b6.webm?t=1771351669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/e06311c07a73ca2170cd4bc51ec565b6.mp4?t=1771351669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/cc6dc6bbd51e122e09d65016fece3f82.avif?t=1771351669\" width=865 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After a while you no longer depend on the rulebook and can start going with the flow, solving chest after chest without issue. After you master all the dungeons the game has to offer, you can test your skills with an endless mode and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/35a2e2a0b50f028affac6e82aeb13b80.poster.avif?t=1771351669\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/extras/35a2e2a0b50f028affac6e82aeb13b80.webm?t=1771351669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Quatsch Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848440/92540316597eb9c67bfcf33aa3f722ee3e9374cf/header.jpg?t=1771351669","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3848440/56946667/6d2f0781564b46e59c4a87307ecd28bbf5874f58/1767650808/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767651608","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3848440/56946667/6d2f0781564b46e59c4a87307ecd28bbf5874f58/1767650808/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767651608","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3848440/56946667/6d2f0781564b46e59c4a87307ecd28bbf5874f58/1767650808/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767651608","id":257260103,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257260103/bebe81e0cd7aade5c508bc45e33f1a25500528c4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767651608"}],"name":"Mimic Sleuth","package_groups":[],"pc_req