.jpg?t=1771351669"}],"short_description":"No chest is safe in this logic puzzle roguelite! These mimic-filled dungeons are just waiting to be looted... but only the most observant and clever adventurers will make it out alive.","steam_appid":3848440,"support_info":{"email":"support@quatsch-games.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, German, French, Russian, Ukrainian, Lithuanian","type":"game","website":null}